OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses look forward to town
OL,4,Acentre purchase
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusiness owners are celebrating a
OL,7,Fcouncil decision to approve buying
OL,8,Fparts of a "run down" town centre for
OL,9,F#13m.
OL,11,FMembers of Stockton Council approved a
OL,12,Fplan to buy areas of Billingham from
OL,13,Fprivate owner Sheet Anchor Evolve (SAE)
OL,14,Fon Wednesday.
OL,16,FAdrian Worth, owner of Billingham
OL,17,FBoxing Academy, said it was "an
OL,18,Fexciting time for everyone in
OL,19,FBillingham" which has brought
OL,20,Fbusinesses "a lot of hope".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
