OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses look forward to town
OL,4,Acentre purchase
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council's deputy leader Paul
OL,7,FRowling said he hoped the purchase
OL,8,Fwould allow the authority to make the
OL,9,Ftown centre "something local people can
OL,10,Fbe proud of". SAE declined to comment
OL,11,Fon the process at this stage.
